{"quest_id": 6560, "name": "月光と群狼", "description": "月見を楽しんでいた一行に襲い掛かる\n狼の群れ。月の輝きに昂る獣を打ち払え！\n＜特定のタイミングで満月が発生＞\n極級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv25）", "modifier_notes": ["特定のタイミングで満月が発生"], "event": "ゴールドラッシュ21(2018)", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 300204, "map_no": 3454, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 75, "exp": 400, "gold": 1200, "drops": [{"card": 133, "c": 2}, {"card": 59, "c": 1}, {"item": 2003, "c": 1}, {"card": 41}], "capacity": 9, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 32, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 280, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 280, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 80, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 109, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097696, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 31233, "global_id": 4852, "spawn_sec": 2}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 9, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2000, "attack": 550, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 550, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 800, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 116, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098496, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 31235, "global_id": 4854, "spawn_sec": 77}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2400, "attack": 650, "base_hp": 2400, "base_attack": 650, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 2000, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 106, "move_speed": 1600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2097472, "race_id": 12, "master_id": 31234, "global_id": 4853, "spawn_sec": 96}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 8, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 520, "attack": 10, "base_hp": 520, "base_attack": 10, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 7, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2099152, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 165, "global_id": 164, "spawn_sec": 105}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1500, "attack": 20, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 20, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "magic_defense": 20, "attack_range": 35, "attack_speed": 10, "attack_wait": 12, "attack_interval": 35, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2105344, "race_id": 11, "special_effect_id": 71, "missile_id": 47, "master_id": 633, "global_id": 632, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 112}], "popups": ["　　　悪天候：満月\n\n・一部の敵の『攻撃力』大幅に上昇", "ヘルハウンド、ワーウルフは\n悪天候『満月』が発生している間\n『攻撃力』がアップします。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "テティス", "text": "ねぇバシラ、月がとっても綺麗よ。", "face": "u37"}, {"name": "バシラ", "text": "わぁっ、まんまるでキラキラしていて、\n本当に綺麗ですね……！", "face": "u28"}, {"name": "カズハ", "text": "ふふ、東の国風のお月見、\n楽しんでいただけているみたいで良かったです。", "face": "u235"}, {"name": "イロハ", "text": "お団子もたくさん作りましたから、\n皆さんで召し上がってくださいね。", "face": "u242"}, {"name": "クルル", "text": "お月さまを見ながらお団子だなんて、\nお月見は本当に素敵ね……！", "face": "u197"}]}, {"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ラテリア", "text": "――ん、ちょっと待って。\nどうやら今夜のお客は、僕達だけじゃないみたいだ。", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "この遠吠え、狼だけじゃない。\nワーウルフも混じっているね。", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "こんな人里の近くに魔物が……！？", "face": "l91883c939536"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "王子、見過ごせば被害が出るかもしれません。\nお月見は一時中断して、狼の対処をしましょう。", "face": "l91883c939536"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "どうやら連中、かなり興奮してるみたいだ。\n『満月』が出ている間は更に凶暴になるから、\n十分に注意するようにね。", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "それじゃあ王子、獣狩りの始まりだ。", "face": "u532"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ラテリア", "text": "ふぅ、何とか片付いたね。", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "イロハ", "text": "近くの村に被害が出る前で、\n本当に良かったですね……。", "face": "u242"}, {"name": "ラテリア", "text": "もう近くに獣の気配は無いから、\nしばらくは大丈夫だと思うよ。", "face": "u532"}, {"name": "テティス", "text": "それなら、お月見の続きにしましょうか。\nお月さまもまだ隠れていませんし。", "face": "u37"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そうですね、まだお団子もありますから。\n王子、こちらへどうぞ！"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map3454", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 132, "y": 258}, {"k": "m", "x": 344, "y": 402, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 199, "y": 293, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 645, "y": 268, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 335, "y": 144, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 433, "y": 194, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 543, "y": 237, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 543, "y": 324, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 445, "y": 355, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 449, "y": 437, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 556, "y": 439, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 759, "y": 288, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 706, "y": 200, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 667, "y": 452, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 159, "y": 407, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 246, "y": 197, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 781, "y": 466, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 784, "y": 153, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 254, "y": 414, "id": 217}, {"k": "r", "x": 109, "y": 348, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 268, "y": 307, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 321, "y": 337, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 619, "y": 195, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 485, "y": 285, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 815, "y": 235, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 771, "y": 350, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 584, "y": 376, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 180, "y": 186, "id": 308}]}, "start_cost": 20, "active": true}